# B&B optimization example for reduction-seed.
# Greedy fixes node 0 to option 0 and pays 1 for the resulting late pair. R2
# accounts for that pair and finds cost 0, which closes the root.
# Run from the repository root.
# Enabled:  ./build-clang-modules/pbqp --solve=bnb -Werror -O0 -fgreedy-seed --numthreads=1 --timeout=0.7 -freduction-seed examples/pbqp/individual/bnb-reduction-seed.pbqp
# Baseline: ./build-clang-modules/pbqp --solve=bnb -Werror -O0 -fgreedy-seed --numthreads=1 --timeout=0.7 -fno-reduction-seed examples/pbqp/individual/bnb-reduction-seed.pbqp
# Observed with Clang 21 Release on Intel Core Ultra X7 358H.
# Median elapsed CLI time over five alternating runs, including startup.
# Enabled: 7.5 ms, 5/5 optimal, COST 0.
# Baseline: 708.1 ms, 5/5 timeout.

PBQP 2
NODES 25
EDGES 3
MATRICES 2
NODE 0 3 0 0 10
NODE 1 2 0 0
NODE 2 2 0 0
NODE 3 2 0 0
NODE 4 2 0 0
NODE 5 2 0 0
NODE 6 2 0 0
NODE 7 2 0 0
NODE 8 2 0 0
NODE 9 2 0 0
NODE 10 2 0 0
NODE 11 2 0 0
NODE 12 2 0 0
NODE 13 2 0 0
NODE 14 2 0 0
NODE 15 2 0 0
NODE 16 2 0 0
NODE 17 2 0 0
NODE 18 2 0 0
NODE 19 2 0 0
NODE 20 2 0 0
NODE 21 2 0 0
NODE 22 2 0 0
NODE 23 2 0 0
NODE 24 2 0 0
MATRIX 0 3 2 DENSE INF 0 0 INF 0 INF
MATRIX 1 2 2 DENSE 0 0 0 1
EDGE 0 23 0
EDGE 0 24 0
EDGE 23 24 1
